      "section_path": [
        "Employee Profile Management",
        "Profile ownership"
      ],
      "text": "The Profile module stores contact details separately from employment terms. Employees can edit their preferred display name, personal contact number, and home address. Legal name, employee identifier, and assigned contract require HR review. Changing an address does not change payroll residency rules automatically. Payroll Operations must confirm any tax configuration change separately before the next payroll cutoff.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
