        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Employee Profile Management",
        "Update contact information"
      ],
      "text": "Contact edits save immediately except legal-name and primary-login changes, which enter Pending HR review. Review normally completes within two business days. The primary work login cannot be replaced with a personal address through self-service. A verified recovery address can receive reset messages only after HR enables that feature for the organization.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
