      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Employee Profile Management",
        "A change taking effect next month"
      ],
      "text": "When a move is scheduled for 2026-10-01, enter that effective date rather than replacing the historical address for September. Managers see the business contact view and cannot browse a home address through the team directory. HR can view the historical address chain for authorized administration. If an address appears in an unrelated screen, report the exposure under Support Escalation & Security Incidents and do not copy it into an ordinary support description.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
